.TH MMCTL 1 "2026-10-12" "MetaMonitor 0.2.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mmctl \- publish and manage MetaMonitor progress slots
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mmctl set
\fIID\fR [\fIPERCENT\fR] [\fB\-n\fR \fINAME\fR] [\fB\-d\fR \fIDETAIL\fR]
[\fB\-s\fR \fISTATE\fR] [\fB\-\-pid\fR \fIPID\fR] [\fB\-\-of\fR \fITOTAL\fR]
.br
.B mmctl done\fR|\fBfail\fR|\fBpause
\fIID\fR [\fB\-d\fR \fIDETAIL\fR]
.br
.B mmctl pipe
\fIID\fR [\fB\-n\fR \fINAME\fR] [\fB\-q\fR] [\fB\-N\fR]
.br
.B mmctl tail
\fIID FILE\fR [\fB\-\-pid\fR \fIPID\fR] [\fB\-\-from\-start\fR] [\fB\-q\fR]
.br
.B mmctl bash\fR|\fBgrass status\fR|\fBenable\fR|\fBdisable
.br
.B mmctl rm \fIID\fR... | \fBclear\fR | \fBlist\fR | \fBpath\fR | \fBshell\-init\fR [\fICOMMAND\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Each slot is one file in the spool directory, holding either a bare
percentage or a JSON object with \fBname\fR, \fBpercent\fR, \fBstate\fR,
\fBdetail\fR and \fBpid\fR.
.TP
.B set
Create or update a slot. Without \fIPERCENT\fR the slot is indeterminate.
With \fB\-\-of\fR, \fIPERCENT\fR is a count out of \fITOTAL\fR.
With \fB\-\-pid\fR, the slot fails if that process dies first.
.TP
.B pipe
Read standard input, echo it unless \fB\-q\fR, and parse its progress.
With \fB\-N\fR, a line holding only a number is a percentage
(\fBpv \-n\fR, dialog gauges).
.TP
.B tail
Follow a growing log file; stop when \fIPID\fR exits.
.TP
.B shell\-init
Print shell functions that run the given commands (default: rsync, wget,
gdal_translate, gdalwarp, ogr2ogr, pip, rclone...) through
.BR mmrun (1)
when their output is a terminal. Use with
\fBeval "$(mmctl shell\-init)"\fR in \fI~/.bashrc\fR.
.TP
.B bash
Manage the \fI~/.bashrc\fR (and \fI~/.zshrc\fR) block that evaluates
\fBmmctl shell\-init\fR.
.TP
.B grass
Manage the \fBLD_PRELOAD\fR line in \fI~/.grass8/bashrc\fR that loads
\fIlibmmgrass.so\fR into GRASS sessions.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
files=(*.tif); n=${#files[@]}; i=0
for f in "${files[@]}"; do
    gdalwarp \-q \-t_srs EPSG:32640 "$f" "out/$f"
    mmctl set batch $((++i)) \-\-of "$n" \-n "Reproject" \-d "$f"
done
mmctl done batch
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B METAMONITOR_SPOOL
Slot directory (default \fI$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/metamonitor/slots\fR).
.TP
.B METAMONITOR_WRAP
Default command list for \fBshell\-init\fR.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR metamonitor (1),
.BR mmrun (1)
